\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  to restart  \highlight22\uc2 FX interventions \highlight\uc2  next month based on rainy day funds\b0\par\par\uc2 421 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 2023\par 17:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds detail)\par \par \uc2 July 21 (Reuters) - \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday it would resume \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  based on its National Wealth Fund (\uc2 NWF\uc2 ) investments from Aug. 1, in addition to mirroring the finance ministry's \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the budget rule framework.\par \par \uc2 It said the limit on such \b \highlight22\uc2 FX interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  was set at 300 billion roubles ($3.33 billion) per half-year to take into account the liquidity situation on the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 "Another bombshell from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," wrote CentroCreditBank Economist Yevgeny Suvorov on Telegram. Less than an hour earlier, the bank had hiked its key interest rate by a more-than-expected 100 basis points to 8.5%.\par \par \uc2 Under its budget rule, Russia is selling Chinese yuan from the fund to make up for a shortfall in oil and gas revenue. It resumed those \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in January after a hiatus of several months, shunning what it terms "unfriendly" Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in addition to carrying out those \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the finance ministry's behalf, said it would also carry out \b \highlight22\uc2 FX interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  related to \uc2 NWF\uc2  investments in rouble-denominated assets.\par \par \uc2 The daily volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be determining the balance of regular \b \highlight22\uc2 FX operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  and investments from the \uc2 NWF\uc2 , Russia's rainy-day fund, which accumulates energy revenue.\par \par \uc2 From January to June this year, the bank said the net volume of \uc2 NWF\uc2  funds invested in the relevant rouble assets had amounted to 288.4 billion roubles, meaning the daily volume of its \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Aug. 1 to Jan. 31, 2024, would be 2.3 billion roubles.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it would buy or sell foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  evenly throughout the day to minimise the impact on the market.\par \par \uc2 The Bank of Russia has mirrored \uc2 NWF\uc2  investments in the past.\par \par \uc2 "Due to a number of circumstances, this was suspended," \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor \uc2 Elvira Nabiullina\uc2  said on Friday. "We believe that now is the time to return to this practice. This is not aimed at influencing the rouble rate, it is really aimed at mirroring our \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 The move to \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in yuan illustrates the growing importance of China's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Moscow's efforts to ensure economic stability amid Western sanctions.\par \par \uc2 Nabiullina on Friday said around 1% of citizens' deposits were held in yuan.\par \par \uc2 ($1 = 90.1675 roubles) (Reporting by Alexander Marrow; Additional reporting by Caleb Davis; Editing by Kevin Liffey and Mike Harrison) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-7-21T16:08:38.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230721ej7l02ekr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
