\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3-Russian rouble sinks past 60 vs dollar to over 2-week lows\b0\par\par\uc2 484 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juli 2022\par 17:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 * Rouble falls past 60 vs dollar for first time since July 11\par \par \uc2 * Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crosses 61 threshold vs euro\par \par \uc2 * Market alert to news on \b \highlight22\uc2 FX interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , budget rule\par \par \uc2 * This content was produced in \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  where the law restricts coverage of Russian military \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Ukraine (Updates prices)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, July 26 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble fell sharply to its lowest in two weeks against the dollar and euro in volatile trade on Tuesday, as the market remained alert to any news on possible \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  or tweaks to \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fiscal rule.\par \par \uc2 By 1520 GMT, the rouble was 3.6% weaker against the dollar at 60.20, its weakest mark since July 11. It had lost 3.2% to trade at 61.10 versus the euro, also a more than two-week low.\par \par \uc2 Jittery trade has characterised the rouble's last few sessions. On Friday, \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut its key interest rate by a bigger-than-expected 1.5 percentage points to 8.0% and said it would study the need for more cuts as inflation slowed and an economic contraction continued for longer than previously expected.\par \par \uc2 "As well as expectations related to the new budget rule, the increased demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be due to continued repayment of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  loans," SberCIB Investment Research said.\par \par \uc2 ROUBLE STRENGTH\par \par \uc2 The rouble failed to capitalise on the peak of a favourable tax period on Monday as it extended its losses, but remains relatively close to the near seven-year highs it hit in late June.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength has concerned officials, because it dents Russia's income from exports of commodities and other goods priced in dollars and euros.\par \par \uc2 The rouble is still the world's strongest-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://emea1.apps.cp.thomsonreuters.com/Apps/NewsServices/mediaProxy?apiKey=6d416f26-7b24-4f31-beb6-1b5aa0f3fafb&url=http%3A%2F%2Ffingfx.thomsonreuters.com%2Fgfx%2Frngs%2FGLOBAL-CURRENCIES-PERFORMANCE%2F0100301V041%2Findex.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\uc2  so far this year, boosted by measures to shield Russia's financial system from Western sanctions imposed after Moscow sent troops into Ukraine on Feb. 24. These include restrictions on Russian households withdrawing foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  savings.\par \par \uc2 Before Feb. 24, the rouble traded near 80 per dollar and 85 per euro.\par \par \uc2 Alfa Capital analyst Alexander Dzhioev said Russia's trade surplus and restrictions on the movement of capital were continuing to support the rouble.\par \par \uc2 "The supply of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the domestic market from exporting companies is still hefty, while demand for this foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is limited due to weak activity from importing companies," Dzhioev said.\par \par \uc2 Russian stock indexes were mixed. The dollar-denominated RTS index was down 1.3% to 1,140.7 points. The rouble-based MOEX Russian index was 2.5% higher at 2,182.5 points.\par \par \uc2 Moscow-listed shares in internet giant \uc2 Yandex\uc2  were up 8.2% after the company reported higher revenue and profit for the second quarter. (Reporting by Reuters; Editing by Alison Williams and Mark Potter) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-7-26T16:33:43.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020220726ei7q02fku\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
