\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Russia without clear alternatives for investing reserves after sanctions\b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 April 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The governor of \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Elvira Nabiullina\uc2 , admitted Monday that the country has yet to find "clear alternatives" for investing beyond the world's major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  following sanctions. The country led by \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2  is facing economic sanctions from the West as a way to condemn the invasion of Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 Thus, as the \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor explained in a parliamentary committee, \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  notes, the country is now limited to only Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and gold.\par \par \uc2 Read Also Read Kremlin closes in on itself to stem capital flight With the Bank of Russia lacking concrete alternatives, the governor noted that it is too early to draw lessons about what Russia could have done differently. "We have to look ahead, but right now I am finding it difficult to give specific suggestions," the Bank of Russia leader indicated. "The list of countries that is issuing net reserves of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  is limited and they are the ones who have taken hostile measures and limited our access," she added.\par \par \uc2 Read Also Read Russia wants gas in rubles. Is it a shot in the foot? The restrictions imposed on the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  state that it cannot \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to defend the ruble, for example.\par \par \uc2 Asked on this occasion whether the bank intends to retaliate against countries that have blocked Russian assets, Nabiullina says that this option is on the table, indicating that it is "certainly planning legal actions of the sort." Still, he stressed that these actions "have to be thought through carefully and need to be justified to have the intended result."\par \par \uc2 Read Also Read Russian real estate giants fit fortunes into the pandemic\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220418ei4i004zb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
