rsement Status: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fitchratings.com/site/pr/10195395#endorsement-status"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.fitchratings.com/site/pr/10195395#endorsement-status}}}\par \par \uc2 Endorsement Policy: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fitchratings.com/site/pr/10195395#endorsement-policy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.fitchratings.com/site/pr/10195395#endorsement-policy}}}\par \par \uc2 ALL FITCH CREDIT RATINGS ARE SUBJECT TO CERTAIN LIMITATIONS AND DISCLAIMERS. PLEASE READ THESE LIMITATIONS AND DISCLAIMERS BY FOLLOWING THIS LINK:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://WWW.FITCHRATINGS.COM/UNDERSTANDINGCREDITRATINGS"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://WWW.FITCHRATINGS.COM/UNDERSTANDINGCREDITRATINGS}}}\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://WWW.FITCHRATINGS.COM/UNDERSTANDINGCREDITRATINGS"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://WWW.FITCHRATINGS.COM/UNDERSTANDINGCREDITRATINGS}}}\uc2 . IN ADDITION, THE FOLLOWING\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://WWW.FITCHRATINGS.COM/RATING-DEFINITIONS-DOCUMENT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://WWW.FITCHRATINGS.COM/RATING-DEFINITIONS-DOCUMENT}}}\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fitchratings.com/rating-definitions-document"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.fitchratings.com/rating-definitions-document}}}\par \par \uc2 DETAILS FITCH'S RATING DEFINITIONS FOR EACH RATING SCALE AND RATING CATEGORIES, INCLUDING DEFINITIONS RELATING TO DEFAULT. PUBLISHED RATINGS, CRITERIA, AND METHODOLOGIES ARE AVAILABLE FROM THIS SITE AT ALL TIMES. FITCH'S CODE OF CONDUCT, CONFIDENTIALITY, CONFLICTS OF INTEREST, AFFILIATE FIREWALL, COMPLIANCE, AND OTHER RELEVANT POLICIES AND PROCEDURES ARE ALSO AVAILABLE FROM THE CODE OF CONDUCT SECTION OF THIS SITE. DIRECTORS AND SHAREHOLDERS RELEVANT INTERESTS ARE AVAILABLE AT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://WWW.FITCHRATINGS.COM/SITE/REGULATORY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://WWW.FITCHRATINGS.COM/SITE/REGULATORY}}}\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK